          "name": "Delete team",
          "request": {
            "name": "Delete team",
            "description": {
              "content": "This API deletes an existing team from your help desk portal. To reassign the open and on hold tickets and tasks of the deleted team to a different team, pass the <b>ticketNewTeam</b>, <b>taskNewTeam</b>, <b>ticketNewAgent</b>, and <b>taskNewAgent</b> team parameters in the API request. If you do not want to assign the tickets to another team, pass the values of <b>ticketNewTeam</b> and <b>ticketNewAgent</b> as null. However, in the case of tasks, either <b>taskNewTeam</b> or <b>taskNewAgent</b> must have a valid value. Both parameters cannot be passed as null.",
